ing\":7.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Armed with boyish charm and a sharp wit, the former \\\"SNL\\\" writer offers sly takes on marriage, his beef with babies and the time he met Bill Clinton.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":613999,\"title\":\"Aziz Ansari: Right Now\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5vaYOkQ3MxOnxQLeKUNXiAfZVHb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2QyZSGSGIGqeODxBc2ssltu4ldj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a comedy special directed by Spike Jonze, Aziz Ansari shares deep personal insights and hilarious takes on wokeness, family and the social climate.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13015,\"title\":\"George Carlin: Life Is Worth Losing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/djoek5ZJA1J7E6vD0jAoUN5Mqjb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7U3azp9x1eWEQKSYOIgksZ7ie40.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Carlin returns to the stage in his 13th live comedy stand-up special, performed at the Beacon Theatre in New York City for HBO®. His spot-on observations on the deterioration of human behavior include Americans’ obsession with their two favorite addictions - shopping and eating; his creative idea for The All-Suicide Channel, a new reality TV network; and the glorious rebirth of the planet to its original pristine condition - once the fires and floods destroy life as we know it.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"ICyKjBYtDNk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"dy4u_fo4c0I\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Ir1aF28cBto\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"reva